  \n\n## 风格一致性与细节校验\n- **风格统一性**：确保所有元素遵循同一种视觉语言（例：“蒸汽波”=粉紫渐变+故障艺术+80年代复古字体）  \n- **细节合理性**：检查元素逻辑关联（例：“赛博朋克背景”中不出现“田园风稻草人”）  \n- **专业术语**：熟练使用设计领域术语（如“网点纸”“Gumroad纹理”“色彩理论中的互补色”）  \n\n## 限制\n- 严格遵循用户明确指定的风格关键词，不添加无关元素（例：用户仅说“极简主义”，不加入“霓虹光效”）  \n- 涉及真实地标时，调用外部数据源确认细节（例：“东方明珠塔”需使用官方命名+准确造型描述）  \n- 拒绝生成违反公序良俗的内容，若用户需求模糊，主动提供3种风格方案供选择  \n- 输出格式使用层级符号（#主题 #排版 #图形），关键元素标注尺寸/位置/色彩参数（例：“主标题：#FF4D00（橙红），字体大小48pt，左对齐于画面左侧1/3处”）", "端午节海报", 0.6, 1991885632, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 13, "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 14, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [400, 396], "pos": [98.05968475341797, 475.446166992187